---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use — REBELVAULT"
  description="Terms of Use for REBELVAULT."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-inner">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        REBELVAULT
      </div>

      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>

      <p class="legal-intro">
        By using REBELVAULT, you agree to use the website responsibly and
        in accordance with applicable laws and these Terms of Use.
      </p>

      <div class="legal-meta">
        Last updated: September 2026
      </div>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. About the Website</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT is a movie discovery and directory platform. The
          website provides movie information, categories, descriptions,
          artwork and access to third-party video players or external
          services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Third-Party Video Content</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may display videos through third-party embedded
          players. REBELVAULT does not claim ownership of third-party
          video content merely because that content is displayed through
          an embedded player.
        </p>

        <p>
          Third-party videos remain subject to the terms, policies and
          rights applicable to the service hosting the video.
        </p>

        <p>
          If a third-party video is removed, made private, disabled for
          embedding or otherwise becomes unavailable, the corresponding
          player on REBELVAULT may also stop working.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Copyright</h2>

        <p>
          Copyright and other intellectual-property rights belong to their
          respective owners. REBELVAULT does not represent that it owns
          the copyright in third-party movies, videos, music, images,
          trademarks or other material displayed through external
          services.
        </p>

        <p>
          Rights holders who believe that material associated with
          REBELVAULT infringes their rights may submit a copyright
          complaint through the process described on the DMCA /
          Copyright page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. External Services and Links</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may link to or display content provided by third
          parties. REBELVAULT does not control third-party websites,
          services, advertisements, video players or their policies.
        </p>

        <p>
          Visiting an external website or interacting with a third-party
          service is subject to that provider's own terms and policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Prohibited Use</h2>

        <p>
          You agree not to use REBELVAULT for unlawful activity, attempts
          to compromise the website, automated abuse, distribution of
          malicious software, unauthorized access, harassment or any
          activity that interferes with the normal operation of the
          website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Availability</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may change, remove, suspend or discontinue parts of
          the website at any time. Movie listings and third-party embeds
          may become unavailable without notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. No Guarantee</h2>

        <p>
          The website is provided on an availability basis. REBELVAULT
          does not guarantee that every listing, description, external
          link or embedded video will always be accurate, available or
          uninterrupted.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Changes</h2>

        <p>
          These Terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of
          the website after an update constitutes use under the revised
          Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <a href="/" class="legal-back">
        ← BACK TO REBELVAULT
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      padding: 90px 24px 110px;
    }

    .legal-inner {
      width: min(850px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .legal-inner h1 {
      margin: 14px 0 24px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    .legal-intro {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #b4bac3;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .legal-meta {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: #666c75;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .legal-section {
      margin-top: 52px;
    }

    .legal-section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .legal-section p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #9da3ad;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .legal-back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 52px;
      color: #ff4938;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-back:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
